6. Collision Audit

6.1. Performance Profiles (Dolan & Moré, 2002)

Pattern: survival function \rho_s(\tau) over tasks. Reference: best solver. Threshold: relative time ratio. Distinct from human-relative margin.

6.2. Empirical Attainment Functions (Fonseca et al.)

Pattern: coverage \alpha_T(z) over objective space. Reference: algorithm runs. Distinct from cognitive task space with human reference.

6.3. Task-Level Stochastic Dominance (Nature, 2026)

Pattern: comparison of AI vs. human CDFs on a single task. Distinct from a margin distribution over a task space.

6.4. Verdict

\boxed{
\textbf{Novel claim: human-relative stochastic dominance of capability margins over a measurable task space.}
}

